# The app's connection to the Megy Prints Supabase project: the same two
# public values the website reads as VITE_SUPABASE_URL and
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY (see ../.env.example and ../src/lib/supabase.ts).
# Copy this file to .env.local (not in git) and fill them in. Metro puts them
# into the app's code when it builds; without them the app says it cannot
# sign in.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key
